tg-expert (0.12.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Record separate measurement runs and save them with their snapshots
    and workshop notes in one session file.
  * Export PDF reports with selected runs and snapshots, graphs and notes.
  * Add a menu bar and make off-scale readings clearer in the graphs.
    See CHANGELOG.md for details.

