tg-expert (0.11.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add live audio listening, beat-error trends and correlation plots.
  * Export Trend data to CSV and configure the settling period after position
    changes.
  * Add algorithm configuration controls and allow accepting a provisional
    calibration estimate when stopping early.
  * Provide more detailed measurement detection status feedback.
    See CHANGELOG.md for the changes.

